  "description": "QELKEA crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C67 H99 N6 O21 Tb3 Zn3 4+,3(Cl1 O4 1-),N1 O3 1-. From the CIF bond table, Tb3 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors; Tb1 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors; Zn1 (Zn) has 3 O neighbors; Zn2 (Zn) has 3 O neighbors; Zn3 (Zn) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.415-4.090 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 98.14-115.96°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Zn3Tb3(μ6-CO3)(μ3-OH)3(L)3(H2O)3]·3(ClO4)·NO3. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 3 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 3 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
